DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The  ssttrrssppnn()  function calculates the length (in bytes) of the initial
       segment of _s which consists entirely of bytes in _a_c_c_e_p_t.

       The ssttrrccssppnn() function calculates the length of the initial segment  of
       _s which consists entirely of bytes not in _r_e_j_e_c_t.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       The  ssttrrssppnn()  function returns the number of bytes in the initial seg‐
       ment of _s which consist only of bytes from _a_c_c_e_p_t.

       The ssttrrccssppnn() function returns the number of bytes in the initial  seg‐
       ment of _s which are not in the string _r_e_j_e_c_t.

